{"scene_id": "s01521", "source": "/home/user/screenwrite-analyzers/data/analyzers/gen/scenes/s01521.fountain", "heading": "INT. GREENHOUSE ON A DISUSED FERRY - EVENING", "cast": [{"id": 0, "name": "ISOLDE FAIRWEATHER-NKEMELU", "names": ["ISOLDE FAIRWEATHER-NKEMELU", "ISOLDE"], "gender": "?", "first": 5, "spoke": 24}, {"id": 1, "name": "DESMOND ACHTERBERG", "names": ["DESMOND ACHTERBERG", "DESMOND"], "gender": "?", "first": 7, "spoke": 24}, {"id": 2, "name": "GRETA", "names": ["GRETA"], "gender": "?", "first": 9, "spoke": 7}, {"id": 3, "name": "OYELARAN", "names": ["OYELARAN"], "gender": "?", "first": 9, "spoke": 0}], "units": [{"u": 0, "kind": "heading", "text": "INT. GREENHOUSE ON A DISUSED FERRY - EVENING", "present": []}, {"u": 1, "kind": "action", "text": "A car ferry long retired from its route, moored and rusting at a quiet estuary.", "para": 0, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 2, "kind": "action", "text": "Its vehicle deck has been roofed with glass and turned into a nursery of citrus trees in tubs.", "para": 0, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 3, "kind": "action", "text": "Lamps hum.", "para": 0, "sent": 2, "present": []}, {"u": 4, "kind": "action", "text": "The air is warm, bitter-sweet, and smells of leaf and engine oil.", "para": 0, "sent": 3, "present": []}, {"u": 5, "kind": "action", "text": "ISOLDE FAIRWEATHER-NKEMELU, 34, sleeves rolled, soil to the elbows, prunes a lemon tree with more force than the tree needs.", "para": 1, "sent": 0, "present": [0]}, {"u": 6, "kind": "action", "text": "Her wedding ring hangs on a string around her neck instead of her finger.", "para": 1, "sent": 1, "present": [0]}, {"u": 7, "kind": "action", "text": "Across the aisle, DESMOND ACHTERBERG, 36, in a good coat that does not belong among the tubs, holds a paper bag of pastries as if it were a summons.", "para": 2, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 8, "kind": "action", "text": "He has not put it down since he arrived.", "para": 2, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 9, "kind": "action", "text": "Between them, perched on an upturned crate and reading a seed catalogue she is not reading, sits MARGUERITE \"GRETA\" OYELARAN, 70, Isolde's landlady and the ferry's last pilot.", "para": 3, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 10, "kind": "action", "text": "Isolde snips a branch.", "para": 4, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 11, "kind": "action", "text": "It falls.", "para": 4, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 12, "kind": "action", "text": "Desmond watches it fall.", "para": 4, "sent": 2, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 13, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "You've moved the tangerines.", "name": "DESMOND", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 14, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "They wanted light.", "name": "ISOLDE", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 15, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "They used to be by the stairs.", "name": "DESMOND", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 16, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Things shift.", "name": "ISOLDE", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 17, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "The lemons shifted too. Nobody asked them.", "name": "GRETA", "speaker": 2, "ext": [], "paren": ["turning a page"], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 18, "kind": "action", "text": "Desmond sets the bag down on a workbench.", "para": 5, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 19, "kind": "action", "text": "Takes it up again.", "para": 5, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 20, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "I brought the ones with the almond.", "name": "DESMOND", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 21, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "I don't eat those anymore.", "name": "ISOLDE", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 22, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Since when?", "name": "DESMOND", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 23, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Since a while.", "name": "ISOLDE", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 24, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "You loved those.", "name": "DESMOND", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 25, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "I loved a lot of things at the time.", "name": "ISOLDE", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 26, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "There's a draught from the east vent. Someone should mind it.", "name": "GRETA", "speaker": 2, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 27, "kind": "action", "text": "Neither of them moves toward the vent.", "para": 6, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 28, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "The bank wrote to me about the account. They said you'd closed your half.", "name": "DESMOND", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 29, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "I did.", "name": "ISOLDE", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 30, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "You could have called.", "name": "DESMOND", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 31, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "I could have.", "name": "ISOLDE", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 32, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "I'd have said yes.", "name": "DESMOND", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 33, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "You'd have said yes to anything, that month.", "name": "ISOLDE", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 34, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "That's not fair.", "name": "DESMOND", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 35, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "It isn't a verdict. It's a date.", "name": "ISOLDE", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 36, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Margins are thin in citrus. People forget that.", "name": "GRETA", "speaker": 2, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 37, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Greta, would you mind--", "name": "DESMOND", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 38, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "I would. I've a view of the water from here and I'm using it.", "name": "GRETA", "speaker": 2, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 39, "kind": "action", "text": "Isolde almost smiles.", "para": 7, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 40, "kind": "action", "text": "Catches herself.", "para": 7, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 41, "kind": "action", "text": "Snips.", "para": 7, "sent": 2, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 42, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Your mother sent a card. To the flat. I didn't know what to do with it.", "name": "DESMOND", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 43, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Put it in the drawer.", "name": "ISOLDE", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 44, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "I did. I took it out again.", "name": "DESMOND", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 45, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "And?", "name": "ISOLDE", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 46, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "It's in my coat.", "name": "DESMOND", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 47, "kind": "action", "text": "He does not reach for it.", "para": 8, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 48, "kind": "action", "text": "His hand rests on the pocket.", "para": 8, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 49, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Keep it.", "name": "ISOLDE", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 50, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "It's addressed to you.", "name": "DESMOND", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 51, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Then it's mine to say who keeps it.", "name": "ISOLDE", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 52, "kind": "action", "text": "Silence.", "para": 9, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 53, "kind": "action", "text": "A pump clicks on somewhere below decks.", "para": 9, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 54, "kind": "action", "text": "Water moves in the pipes.", "para": 9, "sent": 2, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 55, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "You've lost weight.", "name": "DESMOND", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 56, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "You've gained a coat.", "name": "ISOLDE", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 57, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "It was a gift.", "name": "DESMOND", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 58, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "From?", "name": "ISOLDE", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 59, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Does it matter?", "name": "DESMOND", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 60, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Not at all.", "name": "ISOLDE", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 61, "kind": "action", "text": "She drops the shears into a tub.", "para": 10, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 62, "kind": "action", "text": "They ring against the rim.", "para": 10, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 63, "kind": "action", "text": "Both of them look at the sound.", "para": 10, "sent": 2, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 64, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Eighty-one pounds for a Buddha's hand citron. Robbery.", "name": "GRETA", "speaker": 2, "ext": [], "paren": ["to the catalogue"], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 65, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "I'm not here about the account.", "name": "DESMOND", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 66, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "I know.", "name": "ISOLDE", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 67, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "I'm not here about the card.", "name": "DESMOND", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 68, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "I know that too.", "name": "ISOLDE", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 69, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "The lease on the flat is up in March. I wondered if you had a view.", "name": "DESMOND", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 70, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "On the flat.", "name": "ISOLDE", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 71, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "On the flat.", "name": "DESMOND", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 72, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "The east vent really is open.", "name": "ISOLDE", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": ["a long beat"], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 73, "kind": "action", "text": "She walks to it.", "para": 11, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 74, "kind": "action", "text": "Closes it.", "para": 11, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 75, "kind": "action", "text": "Stays there with her back to him, hand flat on the cold iron.", "para": 11, "sent": 2, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 76, "kind": "action", "text": "They speak at once.", "para": 12, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 77, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "I don't know how to be in a room with you.", "name": "DESMOND", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 78, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "I don't know how to be in a room without you.", "name": "ISOLDE", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": true, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 79, "kind": "action", "text": "Nobody moves.", "para": 13, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 80, "kind": "action", "text": "Greta turns a page, slowly, and does not read it.", "para": 13, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 81, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Well. That's the first honest weather of the evening.", "name": "GRETA", "speaker": 2, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 82, "kind": "action", "text": "Desmond puts the pastry bag down for the last time.", "para": 14, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 83, "kind": "action", "text": "Walks the length of the aisle, stops one tub short of Isolde.", "para": 14, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 84, "kind": "action", "text": "A lemon hangs between them, green, not yet ready.", "para": 14, "sent": 2, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 85, "kind": "action", "text": "He lifts it gently on his palm, as if weighing it.", "para": 15, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 86, "kind": "action", "text": "Lets it go.", "para": 15, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 87, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "It needs another month.", "name": "ISOLDE", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 88, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Does it.", "name": "DESMOND", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 89, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "The ones in the light, perhaps three weeks.", "name": "ISOLDE", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 90, "kind": "action", "text": "She turns.", "para": 16, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 91, "kind": "action", "text": "His coat is wet at the shoulder where the roof drips.", "para": 16, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 92, "kind": "action", "text": "She notices.", "para": 16, "sent": 2, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 93, "kind": "action", "text": "Says nothing.", "para": 16, "sent": 3, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 94, "kind": "action", "text": "Takes the string from around her neck, winds the ring once about her finger, and unwinds it again.", "para": 16, "sent": 4, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 95, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Three weeks.", "name": "DESMOND", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 96, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "The flat can wait three weeks.", "name": "ISOLDE", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 97, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "I'll put the kettle on. Down in the wheelhouse. It will take me a good long while.", "name": "GRETA", "speaker": 2, "ext": [], "paren": ["standing, folding the catalogue"], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 98, "kind": "action", "text": "She goes.", "para": 17, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 99, "kind": "action", "text": "Her footsteps ring on the iron stairs, slow, deliberate, deliberately loud.", "para": 17, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 100, "kind": "action", "text": "Desmond picks the almond pastry from the bag.", "para": 18, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 101, "kind": "action", "text": "Offers it.", "para": 18, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 102, "kind": "action", "text": "Isolde looks at it.", "para": 19, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 103, "kind": "action", "text": "Looks at him.", "para": 19, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 104, "kind": "action", "text": "Takes half.", "para": 19, "sent": 2, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}]}